<!-- ============================================================
     500 - SUNUCU HATASI (Purpy Remastered Dark Luxury)
     ============================================================ -->
<div class="flex-grow flex items-center justify-center p-4 py-16 min-h-[60vh]">
  <div
    class="max-w-xl w-full rounded-3xl border-2 p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-2xl text-center backdrop-blur-xl relative overflow-hidden"
    style="
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(32, 14, 22, 0.95), rgba(18, 10, 24, 0.95));
      border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.30);
    "
  >
    <div class="relative z-10">
      <div class="text-8xl sm:text-9xl font-black text-rose-500/10 tracking-tighter mb-2 select-none">500</div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-3 -mt-10 sm:-mt-14 relative z-10" style="color: #ffffff !important;">
        Sunucu Hatası
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-300 font-medium mb-8 max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        İsteğinizi işlerken beklenmedik bir hata oluştu. Lütfen daha sonra tekrar deneyin veya sistem yöneticisiyle iletişime geçin.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
